data.exercise-basic-02|contents[0].text:
{0}Every Live has a lane with an SP Skill Chance.
SP Skills can earn very high Scores, so try placing Idols who have SP Skills.{1}
You can check each Idol's Skills from the Skill icons on the Formation screen, or by long-pressing an Idol to open the Idol details screen.

data.exercise-basic-03|contents[0].text:
{0}
Tap the Lane Information to check each lane's Skill Chances.
On lanes that have A Skill Chances, try placing an Idol who has an A Skill.

data.exercise-basic-06|contents[0].text:
{0}
They take effect when equipped as support for an Idol in Unit Formation.
Equipping Accs with effects that match the Live's tendency can raise the Score you earn.

data.exercise-basic-07|contents[0].text:
{0}
Like Accs, Photos take effect when equipped as support for an Idol in Unit Formation.
Each Photo has its own effect, and equipping Photos with effects that match the Live's tendency can raise the Score you earn.

data.exercise-basic-08|contents[0].text:
{0}
If Mental or Fan Count is insufficient, Skill success rates drop and SP or A Skills may fail.
Mental can be raised with Accs and Photos, and Fan Count by increasing Fan Count and Core Fan through Work.
{1}
You can check the success rate of placed Idols' Skills by tapping "Attending Fan Count".

data.exercise-basic-09|contents[0].text:
{0}
The Skills each Idol has come with a "CT", and once a Skill activates it cannot activate again until its CT reaches 0.
Check the A Skill Chance intervals from the Lane Information, and try forming up while paying attention to each Skill's CT.
{1}
You can check each Skill's CT from the Skill icons on the Idol details screen.

data.exercise-basic-15|contents[0].text:
{0}
You can check the Live's features from the magnifying glass icon.
Forming up to make the most of Live Features lets you earn a higher Score.
